      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Thirteen cases of lymphoma of the bowel in infancy and childhood are presented. There is a marked preponderance in males. The tumour most commonly presents with abdominal pain and intestinal obstruction; the prognosis is poor. Histological findings characteristic of the ;Burkitt' type of lymphosarcoma do not apparently influence survival."},
